  "resource": {
    "body": "<div>\n            \n  <div class=\"section\">\n\n<div class=\"section\">\n<h2>Specific error pages</h2>\n<p>Zotonic’s <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_controller_controller_http_error\"><span class=\"std std-ref\">controller_http_error</span></a> first tries to find an error page\ntemplate that is specific for the HTTP status code, named\n<code class=\"file docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">templates/error.</span><em><span class=\"pre\">status_code</span></em><span class=\"pre\">.tpl</span></code>. So, to override the 404 template,\ncreate a file <code class=\"file docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">templates/error.404.tpl</span></code>.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section\">\n<h2>Generic error page</h2>\n<p>If no specific error page template exists, Zotonic falls back to the generic\n<code class=\"file docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">templates/error.tpl</span></code>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n           </div>",
